              "text": "Inbox item: \"Dentist\". Not a task yet. Rewritten: \"Book dentist cleaning\" (two minutes, do it now). Inbox item: \"Taxes\". Rewritten: \"Gather last year's receipts\" with a due date two weeks out and the Admin category."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "Weekly tidy"
            }
          ],
          "props": {
            "level": 2
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "todo",
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "Delete tasks you no longer believe in"
            }
          ],
          "props": {
            "checked": false
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "todo",
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "Give every open task a due date or a someday label"
            }
          ],
          "props": {
            "checked": false
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "todo",
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "Check the Overdue list is empty or renegotiated"
            }
          ],
          "props": {
            "checked": false
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "text": [
            {
              "text": "Renegotiating a due date is fine. Leaving it overdue silently is what erodes trust in the list."
            }
